// Strata (tiers) and their populations. M1: Tier 1 (Impact Site, Crater
// Seafloor) and Tier 2 (Shallows, Coral Reef).
//
// Species fields:
//   radius:   body radius range in world units
//   count:    population kept alive in the arena (respawned after deaths)
//   behavior: Drifter (wanders slowly), Skittish (flees bigger eaters),
//             Hunter (hunts the player when more than 1.2x its size),
//             Grazer (wanders, ignores everything)
//   speed:    locomotion factor (see metabolism.ron: locomotion)
//   sense:    perception range in own radii
//   shape / color: grey-box presentation hints
